  "problem": "Background termination only woke a cleanup retry callback already installed. A task, owner or Job-registry termination received while provider disposal was still pending was lost if that disposal later failed. The native response remained open with Job stopping and no durable ending; parent/service teardown could wait indefinitely even though another cleanup attempt would succeed.",
